    <title>【往期搬运】对话世界冠军乔治队长？从「无差别冲煮法」到咖啡风味的哲学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69529e212db086f897a85e8c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69529e212db086f897a85e8c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 15:45:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「咖啡师的手艺不在于征服豆子，而在于唤醒它。」你如何定义一杯咖啡的灵魂？又如何在变量中寻找平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目为23年7月的碎碎念直播回放，</span></strong><span>此时的队长已经取得了世界冠军，听众朋友们不妨</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68653e1c93fd2d72b83432d1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68653e1c93fd2d72b83432d1"><span>结合着Coffeeplus播客的访谈一起收听</span></a><span>，看看不同视角、不同时期的队长，会有什么相同/不同的想法？</span></p><span></span><p><span>乔治队长小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e1699af0000000001000fba?xsec_token=YBXZXPGsCaMWsT8Ojm9n8cwPZiPWs-Fje2vxS5khlqZPg=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;&amp;apptime=1767022598&amp;shareRedId=Nzs5QTk2SUI8PkdFPz02P0hGP0k5Oj1B&amp;share_id=1adb6ec084864fdea6e1cf89e6df9dd6&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e1699af0000000001000fba?xsec_token=YBXZXPGsCaMWsT8Ojm9n8cwPZiPWs-Fje2vxS5khlqZPg=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;&amp;apptime=1767022598&amp;shareRedId=Nzs5QTk2SUI8PkdFPz02P0hGP0k5Oj1B&amp;share_id=1adb6ec084864fdea6e1cf89e6df9dd6&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink"><span>点这里</span></a><span>；&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>才鸟和CORE的公众号</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h9x6CCSjT97o10_KcwTGcA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h9x6CCSjT97o10_KcwTGcA"><span>点这里</span></a><span> ；</span></p><span></span><p><span>微胖的公众号</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B4akNwkVMaF44WmvahladA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B4akNwkVMaF44WmvahladA"><span>点这里</span></a><span> ；小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/557a61e967bc6569bc6b5578?xsec_token=YBVutkSXzRh_qugseJUSvWRSKOh24uj-PVmYiNHlHU5mw=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;&amp;apptime=1766329600&amp;shareRedId=Nzs5QTk2SUI8PkdFPz02P0hGP0k5Oj1B&amp;share_id=5b61562a8f29471db37278d8c94e33f5&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/557a61e967bc6569bc6b5578?xsec_token=YBVutkSXzRh_qugseJUSvWRSKOh24uj-PVmYiNHlHU5mw=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;&amp;apptime=1766329600&amp;shareRedId=Nzs5QTk2SUI8PkdFPz02P0hGP0k5Oj1B&amp;share_id=5b61562a8f29471db37278d8c94e33f5&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink"><span>点这里</span></a><span> 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本次对话将颠覆你对水粉比、烘焙曲线和萃取逻辑的认知。乔治队长独创的「无差别冲煮法」系统，与品鉴、水质和烘焙共同构成当代咖啡师的必听内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>看似在讨论冲煮技术，实则揭示了咖啡师与咖啡豆的深层对话哲学。无论你是专业选手还是家庭咖啡爱好者，这些洞察都将成为你风味探索的指南针。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟高光时刻（*为引用原文）</span></p><span></span><p><span>「指定冲煮的关键不是工具，而是通过水粉比捕捉豆子的最佳酸甜比。」*</span></p><span></span><p><span>天然水优于调配水，因离子复杂度更贴近咖啡本质。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「比赛烘焙要对抗第二天尴尬期，膨胀率是秘密武器。」*</span></p><span></span><p><span>深烘豆的一比五水粉比+粗研磨，颠覆传统认知。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「无差别冲煮法不是万能公式，而是动态调整的思维框架。」*</span></p><span></span><p><span>湿度25% vs 70%：烘焙时间可相差20%。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「感官训练的本质是建立风味数据库，喝得少必然说得浅。」*</span></p><span></span><p><span>高原冲煮方案：研磨度调细+85℃水温的妥协艺术。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 世界冲煮大赛中国冠军乔治队长登场，咖啡哲学之旅开启！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">00:02:15</a> 世界赛秘诀：水粉比例是咖啡风味的「魔法钥匙」！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">00:04:14</a> 酸甜平衡的奥秘：调整水粉比，解锁咖啡豆的完美风味！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a> 比赛黄金法则：讨好评审，别只顾自我表达！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">00:10:23</a> TDS调配艺术：40到85区间，打造冠军级咖啡个性！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">00:16:46</a> 世界赛规则大变：更甜更平衡的咖啡成为新标杆！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">00:19:56</a> 精品咖啡趋势：酸度如新鲜水果，明亮感席卷赛场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">00:23:18</a> 咖啡比赛新视角：像米其林餐厅一样注重顾客体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">00:35:59</a> 温度与风味：粗粉慢冲低温果汁感，细粉快冲中温更醇厚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">00:42:58</a> 烘焙挑战：贵阳vs上海，海拔湿度让曲线「失灵」！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2889">00:48:09</a> 极限实验：内蒙3%湿度烘焙，颠覆传统认知！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">01:07:00</a> 滤杯玄学：锥形杯增复杂度，平底杯甜度爆表！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4931">01:22:11</a> 萃取效率对决：高压20秒vs冰滴24小时！</span></p>]]></description>
